## POPIA Compliance Gap Analysis

| # | Condition | Key Gap | Risk Rating |
| :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1 | Accountability | No designated/registered Information Officer | **High** |
| 2 | Processing Limitation | Risk of over collection of PII, No documented legal basis for payroll data | **Medium - High** |
| 3 | Purpose Specification | No privacy notice or disclosure | **Medium - High** |
| 4 | Further Processing Limitation | No risk assessment for sub processors | **Medium - High** |
| 5 | Information Quality | No validation steps exist for updating sensitive data | **Medium - High** |
| 6 | Openness | No ROPA, Employees unaware of rights | **High** |
| 7 | Security Safeguards | Cannot demonstrate security safeguards | **High** |
| 8 | Data Subject Participation | No defined data subject request process | **High** |
